Hello,

Ubisoft and Growtopia take player safety, cheating, and any breach of our codes of conduct very seriously. if your account has been sanctioned, please review our code of conduct and the Growtopian code from the below links to get more information about our rules:

Ubisoft Code of Conduct:
https://ubisoft-mobile.helpshift.com/hc/en/43-ubisoft-mobile-main/faq/849-code-of-conduct-the-way-we-play/

Growtopian Code:
https://ubisoft-mobile.helpshift.com/hc/en/26-growtopia/section/337-the-growtopian-code/ 

Please note that any temporary suspension will be automatically removed when it expires. However, feel free to reply to this email if you believe that the sanction is unwarranted.

However, if  your account is permanently suspended, it will not be released and we will not respond to any further e-mails about it. Also, please remember that if an account is permanently suspended, owners are not supposed to play the game anymore. If they do, this is known as "ban evasion" and, according to our rules and The Growtopian Code, that is eligible for the account's permanent suspension.

Also note that in order to avoid delays and confusion, please refrain from sending multiple cases to support. We will do our best to get to your report as soon as we can.

Best regards,
The Growtopia Team


